!Morph methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'jmv 12/17/2021 11:08:23'!
                   externalizeDistanceToWorld: aPoint
	"aPoint is a delta in own coordinates. Answer is in world coordinates."

	| inOwners |
	inOwners _ self externalizeDistance: aPoint.
