!Number methodsFor: 'mathematical functions' stamp: 'nice 4/23/2011 02:26'!
 copySignTo: aNumber
	"Return a number with same magnitude as aNumber and same sign as self."

	^ self positive
		ifTrue: [aNumber abs]
		ifFalse: [aNumber withNegativeSign].! !

