!Theme methodsFor: 'other options' stamp: 'len 3/29/2021 10:39:24'!
                          windowBorderWidth
	| w |
	w _ Preferences standardListFont pointSize / 11.
	w _ w * (self roundWindowCorners ifTrue: [4] ifFalse: [2]).
	^ w rounded max: 1! !


